<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Q2 Drill 1</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: rgb(255, 145, 55);
      color: rgb(1, 1, 1);
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      padding: 30px 0;
    }

    .title-box {
      background-color: rgb(112, 255, 210);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      display: inline-block;
      box-shadow: 0px 10px 20px 2px rgb(141, 96, 40);
    }

    .outer-container {
      background-color: rgb(255, 204, 77);
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      box-shadow: 0px 10px 20px 2px rgb(83, 80, 66);
    }

    .title-box h1 {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #000000;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .card-box {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 3px;
      padding: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0px 10px 20px 2px rgb(83, 80, 66);
      height: 100%;
    }

    .card-box ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .card-header-yellow {
      background-color: rgb(112, 255, 210);
      border-radius: 3px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #000000;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .card-box li {
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container outer-container text-center">
    
    <div class="title-box mb-5">
      <h1>Volleyball 101</h1>
    </div>
        <br>
       <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTW-sv99X7v9f8cHXNL1unUuwU8o1jQ0jCh6z5prClWoA&s">
        <br>
        <br>
        <br>
    <div class="row g-4 text-start">
      
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card-box">
          <div class="card-header-yellow">
          The Attire
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Teammates must wear matching jerseys and shorts except for the libero who wears a completely different color.   </li>
            <li>Every player must have a clearly visible number displayed on both the front and back of their jersey.</li>
            <li>Players must wear comfortable knee pads to protect themselves from floor burns and bruises when diving for the ball.</li>
            <li>Everyone must remove all jewelry and hard hair accessories before entering the court to ensure safety.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card-box">
          <div class="card-header-yellow">
            The Rules
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Six Players, tach team has six players on the court at a time.</li>
            <li>Three Hits, teams get a maximum of three hits to send the ball over the net.</li>
            <li>No Double Hits, the same player cannot touch the ball twice in a row.</li>
            <li>Rally Scoring, a point is scored on every play, and sets are played to 25 points.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card-box">
          <div class="card-header-yellow">
            The Techniques
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Serving begins every play by hitting the ball over the net from behind the back line.</li>
            <li>Setting controls the ball using an overhead finger touch or forearm pass to setup an attack.</li>
            <li>Spiking drives the ball powerfully down into the opponent court with a high jumping hit.</li>
            <li>Blocking stops incoming attacks at the net using extended arms to deflect the ball back.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
